# Windows runtime workspace (MOCAP_WS\venv) requirements: the verified live/GMR
# pin set from docker/gmr-live/Dockerfile plus the Xsens BVH loader extras
# (GMR_XSENS_DEPENDENCIES in tools/bootstrap_g1_workspace.py). GMR itself and
# this repository are installed afterwards with --no-deps, so GMR's heavy
# setup.py dependencies (torch, smplx, opencv, redis, proxqp) are never pulled.
# Regenerate constraints/windows-runtime.txt after editing (command in its header):
#   uv pip compile tools/windows/runtime-requirements.in --python-platform x86_64-pc-windows-msvc --python-version 3.13 --generate-hashes -o constraints/windows-runtime.txt
